Package: grok-bot-bash
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4.2), curl, jq, coreutils, ca-certificates
Description: bash teammate for Grok
 Chat with Grok from the shell. Each bot keeps a memory file and a
 workspace, and shell commands run only after you approve them.
